  "findings": [
    "Eight events (CACI, ALKT, JBSS, HURN, PARR, CXT, ASPN, COLL) are MAPPED: the provider answered, all 21 required sessions are present for each, none has zero volume, and each has a commitment. For seven of them all four session-return labels (session_2, _5, _10, _20) exist.",
    "CXT's session_20_close_return does not exist, with the reason CORPORATE_ACTION_IN_WINDOW: its cash dividend with ex-date 2026-05-29 falls inside that label's window and nowhere else, as the dry run predicted and as the engine did for Milestone 1's CXT. The other three CXT labels exist.",
    "JBSS's cash dividend (ex-date 2026-04-27) precedes its anchor session 2026-04-29, so it touches none of its labels; all four exist.",
    "NBIX 2026-05-05 no longer errors. It is QUARANTINED on FIRST_PUBLIC_TIME_UNVERIFIED because the owner has not attested it, and the sealed view lists its one corporate action: a cash_mergers item with id b8d80b2b-b0e2-4be3-b612-9325d12d1646, dated 2026-05-18 by its effective_date (it had no ex_date, which is what the dry run failed on). That date falls inside the windows of session_10_close_return and session_20_close_return (recomputed from the calendar), so the engine would suppress those two labels, and not the others, if NBIX is attested. The date equals the filing date of NBIX's 8-K with Items 1.01, 2.01, 2.03, 7.01 and 9.01 in the archived history; the reading that the item is the Soleno acquisition remains an inference, because the sealed view carries no company names, and it cannot show whether the item lists NBIX as acquirer or acquiree. All 21 NBIX sessions are present, so it kept trading through its window.",
    "This is the first run in which the change of ac370f9 (a merger dated by its effective date) did anything on real data; the Milestone 1 acquisition of the same push shows nothing else changed."
  ],
  "not_a_claim": [
    "Not an acceptance of Phase 1b or of the extension, and not an attestation of NBIX 2026-05-05, which stays unattested.",
    "Not a label, a price or a return: the sealed view holds none, and none was read.",
    "Not a pin: the commitments are pinned in config/m5-phase1b-events.json by the commit that follows this record, and take effect only when that is pushed.",
    "Not a finding about the Soleno acquisition or about whether NBIX is the acquirer of the item it lists."
  ]
}
